title: Sponsors
---
sidebar: no
---
body:

Psycopg is open source software, meaning it's free to use! We at the Psycopg team are
able to maintain this thanks to the generosity of the companies and
individuals listed below. Thanks to you, we can continue with the
ongoing development of Psycopg 3, Psycopg 2 and all other related tools!

Sponsorship tiers and their perks are described on our GitHub sponsors page.
Every contribution, large or small, helps keep the project alive and well.
Please consider supporting us! It would be greatly appreciated.
